<urn:atm:triage:finding/BB3-008>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "BB3-008" ;
  triage:title "D3 graft-hermes.json missing procedure field; graft tests undiscovered by the pytest gate; diff-gate test pinned to wrong base ref" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr QA1-I1/QA1-I2 + fenix critical review I3/I4, reviewed at 27e21224c. run_feature_smoke.py::write_report (L813-905) writes \"procedure\": \"graft-hermes\" only into smoke.envelope.json (L899), never into the graft-hermes.json payload itself, though D3 requires the field in both files. The two graft tests under scripts/phase-ai/ are not discovered by .just/run_pytests.py:49-54, so just lint pytests / CI never run them (doc D6 requires discovery). Separately, scripts/tests/test_site_reports_diff_is_generated_only.py:14 diffs against origin/integrate/phase-bb instead of the merge base with develop as the sprint doc and AC3 specify -- a documented-contract deviation, vacuous after merge into that branch, and a CI fragility risk if that ref isn't fetched." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-bb" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "correctness" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:source "qa" ;
